// # Sovereign AArch64 IEEE-754 float smoke
//
// Logline: Adds two decimal floats and prints the sum on ARM64.
//
// Setup: No imports. Used by --aarch64-elf-pure.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Load 2.5 and 4.5.
//   2. Add the values.
//   3. Print the decimal result.

pub fn main() {
    println(2.5 + 4.5);
}
